MFLOW 2
NAME 4-way valve switchyard
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 A blower drives water and oil into a 4-way\nvalve on a cross. East, south and north each\nlead to a bucket of their own.\nOpen and shut the branches to route the flow.\nNorth starts shut.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Select the valve: its E S W N buttons open and\nshut each branch, R steps through the cases.\nOpen north as well and see the flow split.

